# um-texts 1
=== MODIFIER a0
Half the area of effect
The spell's original area of effect will increase by half.
-O+

=== MODIFIER a1
Increased area of effect
The spell's original area of effect will double.
O+

=== MODIFIER a2
Maximum area of effect
The spell's original area of effect will increase threefold.
R++

=== MODIFIER d0
Half the duration
The original duration of the spell will increase by half.
-D+

=== MODIFIER d1
Longer duration
The initial duration of the spell will double.
D+

=== MODIFIER d2
Maximum duration
The original duration of the spell will increase three times.
W++

=== MODIFIER e0
Half the effect
The initial effect of the spell will increase by half.
-E+

=== MODIFIER e1
Increased effect
The initial effect of the spell will double.
E+

=== MODIFIER e2
Maximum effect
The initial effect of the spell will increase threefold.
E++

=== MODIFIER e3
Power' rune
The spell's effect is increased to its limit.
E#

=== MODIFIER fe
Enemies only
The spell will only work on enemies.
:wr

=== MODIFIER ff
Allies only
The spell will only work on allies.
:Pr

=== MODIFIER fg
Goblins only
The spell will only work on goblins.
:Go
=== MODIFIER fh
People only
The spell will only work on humans.
:ld
=== MODIFIER fl
